Third-party material

The sensor-code check (shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/bionicwookiee/g7timing/g7/codecheck/)
was written for G7timing in Kotlin, following the G7 pairing exchange as implemented in LoopKit
G7SensorKit (https://github.com/LoopKit/G7SensorKit, branch next-dev, commit e7fdc36), in
particular G7JPAKE.swift, G7PCert.swift, G7AES.swift, G7Authenticator.swift and
BluetoothServices.swift. That includes the message sequence, the characteristic UUIDs, the round
layout and transcript format, the party identifier and the fixed round-3 randomizer. G7SensorKit
is distributed under this licence:

